   "body": "### Capture result (mac/capture-batch, run 9, PR #400)\nCorpus ids: `W62` (reply with U+2764, U+2764 U+FE0F, U+2714, U+2605 and a lone U+FE0F), `R95f` (its edit form), `R95h` (preview of the same text).\n- BMP emoji are **kept**: accepted, stored unchanged (`content_form`, U+FE0F included) and rendered as UTF-8 characters, never replaced by an image. Only non-BMP characters truncate the post (`W12`).\n\nChanges: LOT-096/LOT-151 need no BMP substitution; only non-BMP characters need the smiley suggestion. HFR-PROTOCOL §6b \"BMP emoji\" and §7 row B13.\n",
